  <link rel="canonical" href="https://outreach-roofing.com/" data-rh="true"><meta name="description" content="Oklahoma's trusted roofing experts. Residential &amp; commercial roofing, storm damage repair, siding, gutters, solar installation &amp; more in Tulsa. Free inspections. Call (918) 850-9992." data-rh="true"><meta name="keywords" content="roofing Tulsa, roofing contractor Oklahoma, residential roofing, commercial roofing, storm damage repair, siding, gutters, solar installation, tree removal, turnkey construction" data-rh="true"><meta property="og:title" content="Outreach Roofing and Construction | Tulsa, Oklahoma" data-rh="true"><meta property="og:description" content="Oklahoma's trusted roofing experts. Residential &amp; commercial roofing, storm damage repair, siding, gutters, solar &amp; more. Free inspections." data-rh="true"><meta property="og:url" content="https://outreach-roofing.com/" data-rh="true"><script type="application/ld+json" data-rh="true">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I know if my roof needs repair or replacement?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Signs like missing shingles, leaks, water damage, or an aging roof (over 12 years) can indicate the need for repair or replacement. Our experts can conduct a thorough inspection to determine the best course of action for your roof's longevity and safety."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How often should I inspect my roof in Oklahoma?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Given Oklahoma's susceptibility to severe weather, including hail and high winds, it's wise to schedule a professional roof inspection at least once a year. However, following significant weather events, additional inspections are recommended to assess any potential damage."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you provide a warranty for your services?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Absolutely! We stand behind our work with a comprehensive warranty covering both materials and labor. Specific warranty details depend on the service provided, and we'll ensure you have all the information upfront."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you help with storm damage and insurance claims?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, our team specializes in assessing storm damage and providing the necessary documentation to support insurance claims. We understand the stress involved and strive to make the process as smooth as possible, helping you navigate insurance procedures with ease."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are there local roofing regulations in Oklahoma?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, there are specific building codes and regulations that govern certain roofing projects, including material standards, installation practices, and permits required for major repairs or replacements. Our team is well-versed in these local requirements, ensuring all our work complies with Oklahoma's regulations for your peace of mind."}}]}</script><script type="application/ld+json" data-rh="true">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebSite","name":"Outreach Roofing and Construction","url":"https://outreach-roofing.com"}</script><script type="application/ld+json" data-rh="true">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"VideoObject","name":"Outreach Roofing & Construction : Who we are!","description":"Learn why Outreach Roofing and Construction is Oklahoma's trusted choice for residential and commercial roofing services in Tulsa.","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/m5yZ69PmbaM/hqdefault.jpg","contentUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m5yZ69PmbaM","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/m5yZ69PmbaM","uploadDate":"2026-03-19","duration":"PT1M10S"}</script></head>
