wBox="0 0 512 512" class="text-blue-400 h-5 w-5 mr-3 flex-shrink-0" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M504 256c0 136.967-111.033 248-248 248S8 392.967 8 256 119.033 8 256 8s248 111.033 248 248zM227.314 387.314l184-184c6.248-6.248 6.248-16.379 0-22.627l-22.627-22.627c-6.248-6.249-16.379-6.249-22.628 0L216 308.118l-70.059-70.059c-6.248-6.248-16.379-6.248-22.628 0l-22.627 22.627c-6.248 6.248-6.248 16.379 0 22.627l104 104c6.249 6.249 16.379 6.249 22.628.001z"></path></svg><span class="text-lg">Flexible Financing Available</span></div></div><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><a href="/contact"><button class="bg-primary hover:bg-primaryGradientEnd text-white px-8 py-4 font-semibold rounded-lg transition-colors duration-200 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl" tabindex="0">Get Free Inspection</button></a><a href="tel:9188509992"><button class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm hover:bg-white/20 text-white px-8 py-4 font-semibold rounded-lg transition-colors duration-200 border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center" tabindex="0"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 512 512" class="mr-2 text-lg" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M164.9 24.6c-7.7-18.6-28-28.5-47.4-23.2l-88 24C12.1 30.2 0 46 0 64C0 311.4 200.6 512 448 512c18 0 33.8-12.1 38.6-29.5l24-88c5.3-19.4-4.6-39.7-23.2-47.4l-96-40c-16.3-6.8-35.2-2.1-46.3 11.6L304.7 368C234.3 334.7 177.3 277.7 144 207.3L193.3 167c13.7-11.2 18.4-30 11.6-46.3l-40-96z"></path></svg>(918) 850-9992</button></a></div><div class="mt-12 inline-flex items-center text-sm text-gray-400" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="w-2 h-2 bg-green-400 rounded-full mr-2 animate-pulse"></div>Available 24/7 for Emergency Service</div></div></div></div><section class="bg-gray-50 py-16 md:py-24"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-12" style="opacity: 0;"><div class="text-center mb-12 md:mb-16" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Trusted by Industry Leaders</h2><p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">Certified experts in roofing and general contracting, recognized for excellence and reliability</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 md:gap-12"><div class="flex flex-col items-center"><div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 p-8 md:p-10 w-full max-w-xs"><img src="/assets/icon-orca.webp" alt="ORCA Certification" loading="lazy" width="200" height="96" class="w-full h-20 md:h-24 object-contain hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300"></div><div class="text-center mt-4"><h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">ORCA Certification</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Oklahoma Roofing Contractors Association</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center"><div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 p-8 md:p-10 w-full max-w-xs"><img src="/assets/icon-angi.webp" alt="Angi" loading="lazy" width="200" height="96" class="w-full h-20 md:h-24 object-contain hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300"></div><div class="text-center mt-4"><h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Angi</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Top Rated Service Provider</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center"><div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 p-8 md:p-10 w-full max-w-xs"><img src="/assets/icon-homeadvisory.webp" alt="HomeAdvisor" loading="lazy" width="200" height="96" class="w-full h-20 md:h-24 object-contain hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300"></div><div class="text-center mt-4"><h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">HomeAdvisor</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Screened &amp; Approved Contractor</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-white overflow-hidden"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto" style="opacity: 0;"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 min-h-[600px]"><div class="relative h-100 lg:h-full overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.95);"><button type="button" class="relative cursor-pointer bg-black group w-full h-full object-cover min-h-[400px]" aria-label="Play video: Your Top Choice in Oklahoma Roofing"><img src="https://i.ytimg.com/vi/m5yZ69PmbaM/hqdefault.jpg" alt="Your Top Choice in Oklahoma Roofing" loading="lazy" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"><div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center"><svg class="w-16 h-16 md:w-20 md:h-20 text-white drop-shadow-lg group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-200" viewBox="0 0 68 48" fill="none"><path d="M66.52 7.74c-.78-2.93-2.49-5.41-5.42-6.19C55.79.13 34 0 34 0S12.21.13 6.9 1.55C3.97 2.33 2.27 4.81 1.48 7.74.06 13.05 0 24 0 24s.06 10.95 1.48 16.26c.78 2.93 2.49 5.41 5.42 6.19C12.21 47.87 34 48 34 48s21.79-.13 27.1-1.55c2.93-.78 4.64-3.26 5.42-6.19C67.94 34.95 68 24 68 24s-.06-10.95-1.48-16.26z" fill="red"></path><path d="M45 24L27 14v20" fill="white"></path></svg></div></button></div><div class="px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 py-12 lg:py-16 flex flex-col justify-center" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateX(30px);"><div class="mb-8"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Your Top Choice in<span class="block text-primary">Oklahoma Roofing</span></h2><div class="space-y-4 text-gray-600"><p class="text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed">At Outreach Roofing &amp; Construction, we understand your roof is your home's first line of defense. With over a decade of roofing excellence, we've become Oklahoma's premier choice for reliable and secure roofing solutions.</p><p class="text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed">Oklahoma's unpredictable weather demands a strong, resilient roof. Our comprehensive inspections ensure your home stays protected year-round. Don't wait for problems to arise – let our experts give you peace of mind today.</p></div></div><div class="mb-10 space-y-3"><div class="flex items-center text-gray-700"><div class="w-2 h-2 bg-blue-400 rounded-full mr-3"></div><span class="text-lg">Comprehensive roof inspections</span></div><div class="flex items-center text-gray-700"><div class="w-2 h-2 bg-blue-400 rounded-full mr-3"></div><span class="text-lg">Storm damage assessment</span></div><div class="flex items-center text-gray-700"><div class="w-2 h-2 bg-blue-400 rounded-full mr-3"></div><span class="text-lg">Insurance claim assistance</span></div></div><div><a href="/contact"><button class="bg-primary hover:bg-primaryGradientEnd text-white px-8 py-4 font-semibold rounded-lg transition-colors duration-200 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl w-full sm:w-auto" tabindex="0">Get Your Free Inspection</button></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-gray-50 py-16 md:py-24"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-12" style="opacity: 0;"><div class="text-center mb-16" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Why Choose Outreach Roofing?</h2><p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">Trusted by Oklahoma homeowners for quality, reliability, and exceptional service</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 lg:gap-16"><div class="relative" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);"><div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 p-8 pt-20 h-full"><div class="absolute -top-8 left-8" style="opacity: 0; transform: scale(0);"><div class="bg-primary rounded-lg p-4 shadow-lg"><img src="/assets/FifthIcon.webp" alt="Insurance Claim Specialists" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64" class="h-16 w-16 object-contain filter brightness-0 invert"></div></div><div><h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Insurance Claim Specialists</h3><p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">We bring expertise in navigating insurance claims with a deep understanding of roofing requirements. Our team ensures smooth claim processing while maintaining the highest standards of quality and reliability in every project.</p></div><div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-24 h-24 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-transparent rounded-bl-full opacity-50"></div></div></div><div class="relative" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);"><div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 p-8 pt-20 h-full"><div class="absolute -top-8 left-8" style="opacity: 0; transform: scale(0);"><div class="bg-primary rounded-lg p-4 shadow-lg"><img src="/assets/WarrantyIcon.webp" alt="30-50 Year Warranties" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64" class="h-16 w-16 object-contain filter brightness-0 invert"></div></div><div><h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">30-50 Year Warranties</h3><p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">We stand behind our work with robust warranties - 30 years for Class 3 architectural shingles and 50 years for Class 4. This reflects our confidence in delivering lasting quality that protects your investment.</p></div><div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-24 h-24 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-transparent rounded-bl-full opacity-50"></div></div></div><div class="relative" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);"><div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 p-8 pt-20 h-full"><div class="absolute -top-8 left-8" style="opacity: 0; transform: scale(0);"><div class="bg-primary rounded-lg p-4 shadow-lg"><img src="/assets/SatisfactionIcon.webp" alt="Customer Satisfaction Guaranteed" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64" class="h-16 w-16 object-contain filter brightness-0 invert"></div></div><div><h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Customer Satisfaction Guaranteed</h3><p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Your satisfaction is our priority. We conduct thorough final walk-throughs to ensure every detail meets your expectations, demonstrating our commitment to excellence and your complete peace of mind.</p></div><div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-24 h-24 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-transparent rounded-bl-full opacity-50"></div></div></div><div class="relative" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);"><div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 p-8 pt-20 h-full"><div class="absolute -top-8 left-8" style="opacity: 0; transform: scale(0);"><div class="bg-primary rounded-lg p-4 shadow-lg"><img src="/assets/StormIcon.webp" alt="Storm Damage Experts" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64" class="h-16 w-16 object-contain filter brightness-0 invert"></div></div><div><h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Storm Damage Experts</h3><p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Oklahoma weather can be unpredictable. Our rapid response team specializes in storm damage assessment and restoration, minimizing disruption while ensuring your home's safety and security.</p></div><div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-24 h-24 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-transparent rounded-bl-full opacity-50"></div></div></div></div><div class="text-center mt-16" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);"><p class="text-gray-600 mb-6 text-lg">Ready to experience the Outreach difference?</p><a href="/contact"><button class="bg-primary hover:bg-primaryGradientEnd text-white px-8 py-4 font-semibold rounded-lg transition-colors duration-200 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl" tabindex="0">Schedule Your Free Inspection</button></a></div></div></section><section class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-primaryGradientEnd to-blue-700 overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10"><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, transparent, transparent 35px, rgba(255, 255, 255,