><p class="text-gray-400">We ensure your property is spotless, leaving it better than we found it</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);"><div class="flex-shrink-0"><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold">05</div></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-center"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Guarantee</h3><p class="text-gray-400">Enjoy peace of mind with our comprehensive warranties and satisfaction promise</p></div></div></div><div class="mt-16 text-center" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);"><div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-primaryGradientStart to-primaryGradientEnd rounded-xl p-8 md:p-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto"><h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Ready to Get Started?</h3><p class="text-blue-100 mb-6 text-lg">Join thousands of satisfied homeowners</p><a href="/contact"><button class="bg-white text-primaryGradientEnd hover:bg-gray-50 px-8 py-4 font-semibold rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl" tabindex="0">Schedule Free Inspection</button></a></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-white py-16 md:py-24"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-12" style="opacity: 0;"><div class="text-center mb-12 md:mb-16" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Get answers to common questions about roofing services and maintenance</p></div><div class="space-y-4"><div class="group" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);"><div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300"><button class="w-full flex justify-between items-center p-6 text-left focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary rounded-lg focus:ring-inset"><span class="text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pr-8">How do I know if my roof needs repair or replacement?</span><div class="flex-shrink-0 ml-2"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center transition-colors duration-300 bg-primary text-white"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 448 512" class="transform transition-transform duration-300 text-lg " height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M240.971 130.524l194.343 194.343c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941l-22.667 22.667c-9.357 9.357-24.522 9.375-33.901.04L224 227.495 69.255 381.516c-9.379 9.335-24.544 9.317-33.901-.04l-22.667-22.667c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941L207.03 130.525c9.372-9.373 24.568-9.373 33.941-.001z"></path></svg></div></div></button><div class="transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out overflow-hidden" style="height: 119px;"><div class="px-6 pb-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed"><div class="border-t border-gray-100 pt-4">Signs like missing shingles, leaks, water damage, or an aging roof (over 12 years) can indicate the need for repair or replacement. Our experts can conduct a thorough inspection to determine the best course of action for your roof's longevity and safety.</div></div></div></div></div><div class="group" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);"><div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300"><button class="w-full flex justify-between items-center p-6 text-left focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary rounded-lg focus:ring-inset"><span class="text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pr-8">How often should I inspect my roof in Oklahoma?</span><div class="flex-shrink-0 ml-2"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center transition-colors duration-300 bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 group-hover:bg-gray-200"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 448 512" class="transform transition-transform duration-300 text-lg rotate-180" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M240.971 130.524l194.343 194.343c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941l-22.667 22.667c-9.357 9.357-24.522 9.375-33.901.04L224 227.495 69.255 381.516c-9.379 9.335-24.544 9.317-33.901-.04l-22.667-22.667c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941L207.03 130.525c9.372-9.373 24.568-9.373 33.941-.001z"></path></svg></div></div></button><div class="transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out overflow-hidden" style="height: 0px;"><div class="px-6 pb-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed"><div class="border-t border-gray-100 pt-4">Given Oklahoma's susceptibility to severe weather, including hail and high winds, it's wise to schedule a professional roof inspection at least once a year. However, following significant weather events, additional inspections are recommended to assess any potential damage.</div></div></div></div></div><div class="group" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);"><div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300"><button class="w-full flex justify-between items-center p-6 text-left focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary rounded-lg focus:ring-inset"><span class="text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pr-8">Do you provide a warranty for your services?</span><div class="flex-shrink-0 ml-2"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center transition-colors duration-300 bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 group-hover:bg-gray-200"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 448 512" class="transform transition-transform duration-300 text-lg rotate-180" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M240.971 130.524l194.343 194.343c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941l-22.667 22.667c-9.357 9.357-24.522 9.375-33.901.04L224 227.495 69.255 381.516c-9.379 9.335-24.544 9.317-33.901-.04l-22.667-22.667c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941L207.03 130.525c9.372-9.373 24.568-9.373 33.941-.001z"></path></svg></div></div></button><div class="transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out overflow-hidden" style="height: 0px;"><div class="px-6 pb-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed"><div class="border-t border-gray-100 pt-4">Absolutely! We stand behind our work with a comprehensive warranty covering both materials and labor. Specific warranty details depend on the service provided, and we'll ensure you have all the information upfront.</div></div></div></div></div><div class="group" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);"><div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300"><button class="w-full flex justify-between items-center p-6 text-left focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary rounded-lg focus:ring-inset"><span class="text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pr-8">Can you help with storm damage and insurance claims?</span><div class="flex-shrink-0 ml-2"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center transition-colors duration-300 bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 group-hover:bg-gray-200"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 448 512" class="transform transition-transform duration-300 text-lg rotate-180" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M240.971 130.524l194.343 194.343c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941l-22.667 22.667c-9.357 9.357-24.522 9.375-33.901.04L224 227.495 69.255 381.516c-9.379 9.335-24.544 9.317-33.901-.04l-22.667-22.667c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941L207.03 130.525c9.372-9.373 24.568-9.373 33.941-.001z"></path></svg></div></div></button><div class="transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out overflow-hidden" style="height: 0px;"><div class="px-6 pb-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed"><div class="border-t border-gray-100 pt-4">Yes, our team specializes in assessing storm damage and providing the necessary documentation to support insurance claims. We understand the stress involved and strive to make the process as smooth as possible, helping you navigate insurance procedures with ease.</div></div></div></div></div><div class="group" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);"><div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300"><button class="w-full flex justify-between items-center p-6 text-left focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary rounded-lg focus:ring-inset"><span class="text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pr-8">Are there local roofing regulations in Oklahoma?</span><div class="flex-shrink-0 ml-2"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center transition-colors duration-300 bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 group-hover:bg-gray-200"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 448 512" class="transform transition-transform duration-300 text-lg rotate-180" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M240.971 130.524l194.343 194.343c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941l-22.667 22.667c-9.357 9.357-24.522 9.375-33.901.04L224 227.495 69.255 381.516c-9.379 9.335-24.544 9.317-33.901-.04l-22.667-22.667c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941L207.03 130.525c9.372-9.373 24.568-9.373 33.941-.001z"></path></svg></div></div></button><div class="transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out overflow-hidden" style="height: 0px;"><div class="px-6 pb-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed"><div class="border-t border-gray-100 pt-4">Yes, there are specific building codes and regulations that govern certain roofing projects, including material standards, installation practices, and permits required for major repairs or replacements. Our team is well-versed in these local requirements, ensuring all our work complies with Oklahoma's regulations for your peace of mind.</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="text-center mt-16" style="opaci